WEBVTT

00:02:58.284 --> 00:03:00.479
these are the two factors
that always come out.

00:03:00.503 --> 00:03:02.210
One is reciprocity,

00:03:02.234 --> 00:03:05.789
and associated with it is a sense
of justice and a sense of fairness.

00:03:05.813 --> 00:03:08.006
And the other one is empathy
and compassion.

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:12.281
And human morality is more than this,
but if you would remove these two pillars,

00:03:12.305 --> 00:03:14.434
there would be not much
remaining, I think.

00:03:14.458 --> 00:03:16.113
So they're absolutely essential.

00:03:16.137 --> 00:03:18.005
So let me give you a few examples here.

00:03:18.029 --> 00:03:20.729
This is a very old video
from the Yerkes Primate Center,

00:03:20.753 --> 00:03:23.076
where they trained
chimpanzees to cooperate.

00:03:23.745 --> 00:03:26.191
So this is already
about a hundred years ago

00:03:26.215 --> 00:03:29.307
that we were doing
experiments on cooperation.

00:03:29.331 --> 00:03:32.863
What you have here is two
young chimpanzees who have a box,